     "body": "## What\n\nTwo routing groups hold the same three image models, but only one of them lets the members be reordered.\n\n| Group | How the members joined | Buttons on each member row |\n|---|---|---|\n| `gpt-image-2.5` (created by hand) | matched by a pattern (row shows「按模式匹配」) | 跟随分组推理 · 标准速度 — no 上移 / 下移 / 移除 |\n| `auto-gpt-image-2-5-sunburst` (created by magpie's auto-discovery) | added to the group explicitly | 跟随分组推理 · 标准速度 · 上移 · 下移 · 移除 |\n\nThe page states the order matters: 「排第一的模型决定本组对外的能力；按顺序模式下从上往下尝试」. In the hand-made group there is no way to change which member comes first.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a routing group by hand and let a pattern add three image relays that all serve the same model.\n2. Open Settings → Routing groups → that group.\n3. Compare it with an auto-discovered group (`auto-gpt-image-2-5-sunburst`) whose members were added explicitly.\n\n## Expected\n\nThe order of members in a hand-made group can be changed the same way as in the auto-discovered group.\n\n## Actual\n\nMembers that joined through a pattern have no 上移 / 下移 (and no 移除) on their row — only 跟随分组推理 and 标准速度. The same three relays, added explicitly in the auto group, do have 上移 / 下移 / 移除.\n\n## Version / environment\n\n- magpie **v0.1.2104**, official Docker image (`ghcr.io/yetone/magpie:latest`)\n- Image providers: three self-hosted OpenAI-compatible relays (relay A / B / C), all serving `gpt-image-2.5-sunburst`\n- Environment details removed.\n\n## Related\n\n- yetone/magpie#2730 and yetone/magpie#3016 report the same shape: a member that joined through a pattern cannot be reordered. yetone/magpie#2730 has a fix branch (`fix/2730-deepseek`, commit `d8758e8`) that is not merged yet, and the behaviour is still present on v0.1.2104.\n\n## 中文摘要\n\n同一批三个图像中转（A / B / C）在两个路由组里的可操作性不一样：\n\n- 手动建的组 `gpt-image-2.5`，成员是「按模式匹配」进来的 → 每行只有「跟随分组推理」「标准速度」，没有上移 / 下移 / 移除\n- magpie 自动发现的组 `auto-gpt-image-2-5-sunburst`，成员是显式加入的 → 每行有上移 / 下移 / 移除\n\n页面写明「排第一的模型决定本组对外的能力；按顺序模式下从上往下尝试」，所以手动建的组里没法决定谁排第一。开发仓库 yetone/magpie#2730 / #3016 描述的是同一现象，#2730 上已有 fix 分支（`fix/2730-deepseek`）但尚未合入，v0.1.2104 上仍然复现。\n",
